    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10921" root="خضل" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَضْلٌ</span></b>  <i>Moisture.</i> (TA. [But perhaps this may
be a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَضَلٌ</span>, inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَضِلَ</span>.]) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also, (JK, T, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَضَلٌ</span></b> , (ISd, K,)
<i>Pearls:</i> (JK, K:) or <i>clear large pearls:</i> (K:)
or <i>good, clear, lustrous, large pearls:</i> of the dial.
of Yethrib. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A well-known kind of
beads:</i> (ISk, K:) or <i>a red bead:</i> or <i>a bead of
ivory:</i> (TA:) n. un. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُرَّةٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَضْلَةٌ</span>, (TA,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَاضِلَةٌ</span></b> , (JK,) <i>A clear large
pearl.</i> (JK, TA.)

